! player~quikstats

Refreshes the current prompt and player/ship quickstats from the live game output.

''Include:'' [[player.ts]]
''Defined at:'' `/include/player.ts:482`

!! Loaded Variables
* `$player~unlimitedgame`

!! Source Excerpt
<pre>
#-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-
setvar $player~current_prompt &quot;Undefined&quot;
setvar $player~quikstats_retry 0
if ($player~towed = 0)
	setvar $player~towed &quot;&quot;
end
loadvar $player~unlimitedgame
</pre>

